    ],
    "addExistingPrerequisiteIds": [],
    "rationale": "Whole oxidation-number-method mastery is not a universal prior barrier. Retained f0939f88 requires independent balanced electrode reactions, electron balancing, metallic electron paths and inner ionic charge balance. Its retained 16da6a4d -> 04fa0ba1 path preserves electron donor/acceptor roles. Neutral oxygen/acidic hydrogen balancing and impressed-current transfer remain requirements within corrosion. No balancing or corrosion criterion is weakened.",
    "counterexampleBoundary": "Direct atom/charge balancing supplies Zn/Fe oxidation, O2 + 2H2O + 4e- -> 4OH- and 2H+ + 2e- -> H2 without the formal oxidation-number method for polyatomic species.",
    "scientificResolutionReceipt": {
