      "addExistingPrerequisiteIds": [],
      "rationale": "Retained 1286f2fe supplies net exothermic/endothermic direction and system distinction. The target gives the bond changes, counts and qualitative equal-reference energy bars, then teaches the separation/bond-formation energy balance and its model limit. Dalton history, isotope criticism and independent compound mass-ratio derivation add no required prior action.",
