      "addExistingPrerequisiteIds": [],
      "rationale": "The target is qualitative electron-pair-binding explanation. Current tasks provide H1s1/Cl singly occupied valence orbitals, opposite spins and the energy-distance model. The few nucleus/electron charge and overlap concepts belong to teaching this model within the target, followed by H2-to-HCl transfer; no independent Rutherford, isotope, wavefunction or orbital-configuration derivation is demanded. A merely unwritten lesson introduction is not evidence of a new prior-skill gap.",
